                            QUERY PLAN                            
------------------------------------------------------------------
 Subquery Scan on "*SELECT* PseudoCollationReplace 3"
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: ((char_tbl.f1)::char(4)) COLLATE "binary"
         ->  HashAggregate
               Group Key: ((char_tbl.f1)::char(4))
               ->  Append
                     ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on char_tbl
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on char_tbl_pkey
                     ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on char_tbl char_tbl_1
